  "description": "Operating Area: Southern Andaman Seas (Phuket and Surroundings, Mu Ko Similan Marine Park, Phang Nga Bay and Krabi, Phi Phi Islands, Racha Islands, Koh Lipe and Butang Archipelago, Koh Samui, Koh Chang, Krabi National Park)\n\nExperience the pinnacle of luxury aboard Camara C, an exquisite gentleman's yacht now available for charter. Immerse yourself in the timeless beauty of this meticulously restored vessel, which has recaptured its former glory from 1961, offering an unparalleled experience for discerning travelers. Anchored in the enchanting waters of Phuket, Camara C awaits to take you on a voyage of discovery through the hidden gems of the Andaman Sea.\n\nWith its impressive length of 32m/105', Camara C boasts spacious and opulent accommodations for up to 10 guests across 5 suites. Every detail has been carefully considered to ensure maximum privacy and comfort, with distinct areas for guests and crew. Prepare to be pampered and indulged as you embark on an extraordinary super yacht charter experience.",
